{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_08EE30","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"承担潜伏特工背叛的责任，并成为载人航天器开发的实验对象……这就是下达给The Boss的新命令。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":128,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"当时NASA已经让黑猩猩“Ham”完成了太空弹道飞行。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"接下来，是为了把黑猩猩换成人类而进行的一系列地面实验。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"耐G实验、失重实验、加压氧环境模拟、宇航服测试……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"其中有些实验伴随着巨大的危险，甚至无法让被媒体奉为英雄的“Original 7”来当受试者……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":124,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"命令就是：代替他们，成为那些实验的受试者。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"她本可以拒绝命令，与CIA争辩自己的立场。可是，她没有那么做。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"她说：“我在军旅生涯中积累的经验，很可能对那些实验有所帮助。既然如此，我认为自己就应该接受。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"成果很快就出现了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"The Boss不只是充当受试者，还根据自己的经验，向工作人员提出准确的建议。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"NASA的计划再次加速。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":28,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"照这样下去，总算有希望把人送上太空……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"NASA高层也对The Boss的能力深感佩服，开始把她当作第八名宇航员——“Original Lady”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":112,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"我交给你的那张照片，就是那时候拍的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"当然，那也可能是为了把她包装成“首位女性宇航员”，用于宣传……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"就在终于看到希望的时候，新的难题又落了下来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"政府突然要求：“给航天器装上窗户。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"当时NASA的航天器没有窗户。“Ham”也没能看到太空。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":70,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"可政府得到情报，说苏联的航天器装有窗户，于是急了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"太空开发本身也是一种宣传。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"让名为“宇航员”的‘英雄’讲述从太空看到的景象……这才是关键。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"更重要的是，绝不能出现“苏联做得到，而我们做不到”的事……这就是他们的逻辑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"这只能说是一道蛮不讲理的命令。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"本就已经不可能完成的日程，又要加入新的不确定因素。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"装上窗户会降低结构强度，也会给宇宙射线屏蔽带来问题。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"他们当然不可能让媒体宠儿“Original 7”坐进这么危险的航天器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"最后被选为飞行员的，是The Boss……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":50,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"这个计划就算发射成功，活着回来的概率也不到两成。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"即便如此，The Boss仍然若无其事地继续协助修改<R=宇宙船,MERCURY>的设计。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=宇宙船,MERCURY>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"她在NASA的每一天，简直就像是在亲手打造自己的棺材。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"就在这时，传来消息：苏联的载人飞船“Vostok”已经被运到了发射场。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":31,"cn_text":"苏联预定就在明天——4月12日发射……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""}]}